	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Open Solana transactions, accounts, tokens and blocks from Alfred.

sol &lt;signature&gt;       → transaction
sol &lt;address&gt;         → account (or token, second result)
sol &lt;slot&gt;            → block
sol token &lt;mint&gt;      → force a type: tx, account, token, block

Short aliases: t, a, tok, b.
↩ open in browser · ⌘↩ copy URL · ⌘C copy URL

The explorer (Solscan by default) and cluster are set in Configure Workflow.</string>
